WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.330
Find out if she's a virgin!

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.170
Please don't resist!

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.380
Hold her down!

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.130
Priestess or not, the rules are absolute!

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:10.460
Sayless!

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.840
Takuya!

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.970
She's speaking, too?

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.760
Takuya, run!

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.600
Unbelievable...

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.520
So she offered both her body
and her soul to that man?

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.320
You bastard!

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.340
Daddy!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:35.480
"Episode 20: Into the Rafaelo Desert"

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.740
Do you know who you
just drew your blade on?

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:44.830
I don't give a shit.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.830
You just broke into my house
and attacked my wife...

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.540
Are you bandits or somethings?

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.090
Which of us is the bandit?

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:57.710
You killed Ailia the knight
and stole this house!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.220
I did not!

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.390
You mistook a member of the
imperial city's royal guard for a bandit?

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.010
Even for a country dweller, that's an insult.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.060
What?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.230
We're taking the priestess.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.650
This is the order of the Divine Emperor.

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:19.650
I don't care whose order it is.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:22.160
You can't have Sayless!

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:25.450
Takuya, get out of here, now!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.660
Be quiet, please!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.120
Sayless!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.250
Damn it!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.710
You...

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.220
Know your place!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.380
Takuya!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.760
Keyares-<i>sama</i>! What are you...

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.190
Please, don't!

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.410
Takuya...

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:12.000
I'll never forget you!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.920
No, Sayless! Stop it!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.880
Don't do it! Sayless!

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:27.600
Takuya, I love you.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.830
What is it, Kunkun?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:53.660
I just want to get home as soon as I can!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.460
Jeez!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.180
Mommy?

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.390
Why?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.410
You and I will become one.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.660
Become one?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.710
I love you, Yu-No.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:51.220
This can't be happening...

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:53.600
Tell me this is some kind of joke...

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.650
Sayless! Sayless!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.040
I'll kill you!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.540
I'll kill every one of you!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.750
I'll deal with the man.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:26.260
Leave him. For now, we need to take
Keyares's body back to the imperial capital.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:29.010
Hey, look what I found inside!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.340
Is that...?

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:32.390
Impossible!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.850
The sacred treasure of the imperial capital!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:36.890
No! That's...!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.190
He stole the sacred treasure, too?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.690
What a monster!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.270
We're leaving!

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.630
Daddy! Daddy!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.840
Wake up, Daddy!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.930
Yu-No...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.390
Daddy!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:18.850
I couldn't protect her.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:22.020
I couldn't protect Sayless.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.280
I'm sorry, Yu-No.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.610
Daddy...

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.280
Mommy didn't go anywhere.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:39.910
She's inside my heart now.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.170
Right here.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.630
See?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:47.340
You...

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:50.420
I became one with mommy.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.260
Oh, this is what she says.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:58.970
"The three of us will always be together."

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:24.580
Yeah, we're together...

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.330
Sayless...

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:36.300
So Keyares had already
lost the right to be a priestess

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.930
to the man who stole the sacred treasure?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:39.970
Yes, sir.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.980
Suicide, though?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.980
I suppose it's a fitting end
to a fallen priestess, but...

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:50.360
Without the priestess,
the ritual cannot be held.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:55.410
Indeed. The world is in danger.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.370
Mother has spoken.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:02.870
Keyares had a daughter, she says.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.120
Find her!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.330
Yes, sir!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.630
What of the man who was with her?

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:11.630
He's probably died in the desert by now.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.260
Who is he?

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:19.850
We don't know.
But the priestess called him "Taku Ya."

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.350
Takuya...?

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:39.070
I'm sorry. We can't take enough food for you.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:43.080
Bye-bye, Kunkun.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.750
Bye-bye!

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:51.040
No!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.010
The desert is very dangerous!

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.550
I can't take you!

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.720
Kunkun!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.690
I hate you!

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.780
Sorry.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:24.830
Thanks for being Yu-No's friend, Kunkun.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.580
Bye!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:51.230
This may be the worst choice I could make.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.110
But I have to go to the imperial city anyway.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:11:01.280
I need to get back the Reflector Device
and get the psychite for Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:14.250
Look, Dad!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.590
There's a town over there!

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.420
Hooray!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.300
Yu-No, there's no point in going.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.430
Why?

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.720
That's a mirage.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:28.220
An illusion caused by the bending of light.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.230
It's not real.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.150
It's not?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.240
I'm sleepy, Daddy.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.660
You can sleep if you want, but don't fall.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:48.830
Okay...

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:51.580
We're not there yet, huh?

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.960
We can have a relaxing date
till we get there, okay?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:57.380
Sure. What's a date?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.370
Here.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.740
This is your water, right, Dad?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:35.210
I just don't want any more
water today, that's all.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.130
Hey, Daddy.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:44.260
We'll be at the imperial capital soon, right?

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.390
Yeah. We're almost there.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.640
We keep having this conversation...

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:59.400
But it's the one hope that Yu-No has.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:03.110
I know it's meaningless, but I can't stop.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:12.450
What is this?

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.290
There's lots of them, huh?

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:17.250
It almost looks like somebody's been
dumping coffins they wanted to get rid of.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:26.010
There's nothing inside.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:46.320
Daddy, another mirage...

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.650
He's saying he's tired.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.650
Yeah.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.160
Eat it.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:40.500
Thank you for all you did for us.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.250
We're out of food and water.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:47.510
All I can do now is pray
to heaven we're not out of luck.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:08.280
Yu-No! Wake up, Yu-No!

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:12.120
Daddy, we're almost there, right?

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.920
Water! I need water!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.670
Just a little bit of water!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.710
I need water for Yu-No!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.810
Damn it...

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.230
Another mirage?

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.730
No, wait.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:44.360
The sun's not up yet!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.620
An oasis!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.330
A real oasis!

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.340
Yu-No! I'm so glad...

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.740
Oh? Is there another hot naked girl over there?

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.450
Where? Where?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.710
Hi there.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.340
You planning on having
your way with me, aren't you?

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.300
You pervert! Beast! Brute!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:53.420
You're going to use to me to satiate
your manly lusts, aren't you?

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.010
You're going to make me
your sex slave, aren't you?

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.800
What are you talking about?

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:57.970
Come on, do it.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:00.310
Have your wicked way with me!

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:02.600
I'm ready for it!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.230
What is your problem?

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.730
Daddy?

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:15.360
You came to beat up the Divine Emperor?

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.410
Yes.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:20.240
Is that so important you needed
to take a kid across the desert?

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.500
I need to punch him in the mouth,
or I won't feel satisfied.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.460
Is that a problem?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.870
Not really.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.540
But...

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.510
You're up against the wrong guy!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.800
Why do you want to punch the Emperor?

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:38.050
I'll leave that to your imagination.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:42.060
So, what about you? Um...

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.600
Sarah.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.560
What are you doing here?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:50.480
The imperial city is dangerous
these days, thanks to the rebels.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.900
So I gave up on it and ran.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.110
Rebels? Some kind of resistance?

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:59.990
Yup. People who want to defeat
the Divine Emperor, just like you.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.700
When you get there, you should go talk to them.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.870
I'm not interested in making friends.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.420
I just...

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.540
You just want to punch the guy?

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.250
Yeah, basically.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:16.090
You really are an interesting guy.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.270
Daddy! Look at me!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.700
It feels so good!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:42.330
Yu-No-<i>chan</i>, you're looking a lot better!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.330
Yeah!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:47.500
I'm sure it's because
I talked with you so much!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.290
It was so much fun!

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:54.920
It's my first time talking
with another girl so much!

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.880
What about your mom?

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.930
Mommy didn't talk.

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.760
She was really quiet, huh?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.890
No, that's not it.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.850
Mommy was...

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:12.270
Okay, got it.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:16.690
I'm not supposed to talk
to strangers about mommy?

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.190
Okay.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.360
Got it.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.160
Who are you talking to, Yu-No-<i>chan</i>?

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.530
Mommy's right here, and...

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.160
I can't say that either?

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.000
We've got it kinda tough, huh?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.550
So, how long are you
going to keep following us?

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.720
You fled the capital, right?

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.560
I'm worried, though!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:51.770
I can't just abandon somebody who's
talking about punching the Emperor.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.230
A rain of blessings...

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:00.990
There it is.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.610
It's really going to come down hard,

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:05.780
so let's rest in that temple.

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.460
How do we open it?

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.130
Leave it to me!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:21.840
Ta-dah.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:27.470
Push here, now here, and done!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:38.480
I'm starting to understand
why you ran away from the capital.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:41.990
I'm just very good with my hands, is all.

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:44.660
Hey, Daddy...

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.070
What is it?

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:51.290
My heart keeps pounding.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.580
Your heart?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.370
Guys!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.920
He's the one on the bounty poster!

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.800
Sarah, you bitch!

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.390
Don't blame me, okay?

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:10.640
You've got a huge bounty on your head!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.810
He's the one who defiled
Keyares the priestess?

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.610
Then is that girl...

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:19.650
The priestess's successor?

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.780
No! Let me go!

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:27.780
Daddy! Daddy, help me!

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:31.120
Yu-No! Yu-No!

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.300
What is this place?

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.260
The quarry.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:53.060
Or maybe I should say, the prison.

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:54.600
Prison?

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:03.360
That's...

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:40.040
"Episode 21: The Quarry Where Demons Rule"

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:40.040
Episode 21: "The Quarry Where Demons Rule."
